<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya ivili lya Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya ivili lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya ivili lya Petelo iyandikwa na Mndumindumi Petelo ila wasomi watangala wa hinaa wakwinila ng'ogha yiwa ni Petelo kayandika inguwesekana yiwa kuvile na mundu ayandikili badili gha Petelo. Yula ayandika angulonga yiwa ailolile kwa mihu ngalilu gha Yesu nesu nesu pala Yesu paahyukili wuso ghaki hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 1:17-18 ikiva Petelo ndiwa yula kayandika lihamba hai inguwesekana ayandikili akiva ku Loma kumwihu gha machuva gha 60 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito na pambila gha kuhova kwa mweni Petelo. Hilahila anguikema lihamba hai handa lihamba ghaki gha ivili hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 3:1 paayandikili badili gha lihamba gha mtumbulo. Ayandikili lihamba hai kwa wakilisito wogha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petelo ayandikili lihamba hai ili kuwapegha moyu wakwinila kulama maheli na kuwakanisa wakotoho kuwakovekela wavula gha uhwangi hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 2. Akiwapegha moyu kupughanya wandu wailongile yiwa Yesu kangukawila kuhuya. Badili ghaki angulonga yiwa Sapanga kakawila ng'ogha ila angupala kila mundu alokoki hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 3:8-9. Hali ndiwa lukani lya kulama ngalilu maha hai inguwoneka ku Sula 3:14.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo angujimanyisa mweni na kuwamanyisa wala anguwayandikila hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Anguwakumbusa wandu watami ngalilu gha maha kwaikiva Sapanga angutuwesesa kulama nagha hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 1:3-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo anguwakanisa kulongela wavula wa uhwangi na kulonga yala yatewakola lipindi lya kumwihu hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 2:1-22.</para>
  <para style="io">Badili gha hagha Petelo anguyomola kwa kuwataya moyu wakwinila kulama ngalilu maha wakijiyandala kwa kuhika Kilisito lihanja lya ivili hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 3:1-17.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />lihamba hai inguhuma kwa nenga Simoni petelo, mtumikila na mndumindumi wa Yesu kilisito,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">ninguwayandikila mwenga kupitila kwa kupegha kwa kukotoho kubhaghula kwaki Sapanga wa twenga na mlokola Yesu Kilisito mpokela ukwinila hulahula gha galama ngulunga hila tuipokela na twenga.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ninguwatakila manemu na ukwinila ngeju kwa kummanya Sapanga na Yesu Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhaghulwa na mkemwa na Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Kwa uweso ghaki Sapanga katupegha kila kindu tukipalwa ku ngalilu gha twenga ili tulikali ngalilu gha kumuhekelesa mweni, kwa kummamya mweni atukemili kwa ukulu ghaki na ulungwana ghaki. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, atupeghili laghilo ngulu na gha galama zila atulaghilili. Ili kupitila malaghilo hagha tulikali kwa kumkovekela Sapanga na kuhuka kuubyodogha hula uyegha lumatamata lwa maha ng'ogha lwa mumlimawogha. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Kwaikiva nagha, myangalayi kuukwinila wa mwenga muyongesi ulungwana, na kuulungwana muyongesi kujivula, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />na kwa kujivula muyongesi kujilongosa mweni, na kukujilongosa muyongesi kufumilila, na kukufumilila kwa mwenga myongesi kumtundamila Sapanga, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />na kukumtundamila Sapanga muyongesi upalo wa ulongo, na kuupalo wa ulongo muyongesi upalo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Mighalu hai hyogha paiwela kwa mwenga kwa utangala mtewela ng'ogha wapweli na mteleka ng'ogha kughola mighalu maha kuhabali gha kummanya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ila mundu yoyosi avile ng'ogha na hagha mundu hayu kawesa ng'ogha kulola kutali na ni angali kulola. Kaisemwa vila kalekeselwa sambi syaki haku dahile.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, walongu ghangu, myangalayi kuhighilisa kukemwa mwenga na kuhaghuliwa kwa mwenga kwaikiva pamghola nagha mteguwa ng'ogha katu, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />na mtepokelwa kwa umaha muyingili ku Unkosi wa machuwa yayendelela wa Bambu na mlokola wa twenga Yesu kilisito.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Kwa nagha niteyendelela kuwakumbusa mighalu hagha machuwa hyogha, hata ikawela mngumanya na mvile wagangamala kuuchakaka mlivulili. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Nenga ningulola ni maha kuwakumbusa mighalu hagha lipindi nambila kulama, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Kwaikiva ningumanya yiwa lipindi lyangu lya kuhwegha lya pabehi handa Bambu anilongilile lipalalipala. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Niteyangala nesu kuwapatila njila gha kuwesa kukumbwike mighalu hagha, machuwa hyogha hata badili gha kuhwegha kwa nenga.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Twenga tulolile ukwilikihi wa kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Patuwamanyisa ukulu wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito tutumila ng'ogha luhumu waliundila kwa ukalamuka ila tuulolile ukwilikihi ghaki kwa mihu gha twenga twaweni. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Kwaikiva apokelili utundamilu na ukwilikihi palihuma lilowi kuhuma kwa mweni yula avile mkwilikihi na mkulu, paalongili, “Hayu ndiwa mwana ghangu mpalwa nipalilwi na mweni.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Twenga wenibaha tuhyoghanilili lilowi kuhuma kundumba patuwelili pamonga na mweni kunani gha litumbi lya Sapanga.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kangi ujumbi wa walota ungutuhighilisila mghalu hau na mwenga mteghola maha ikiva mngaliuyughanila nesu, kwaikiva ni handa mlangaso ungung'ala kulwisa, mbaka lichuwa lila pakuchia na ndondwa gha malawila ing'ali kumioyu gha mwenga. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Pamonga na hagha hyogha mngupalwa mmanyi yiwa kwahela ulota ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga uhika kwa kughalambulwa handa aipalile mlota mweni, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />kwaikiva kwahela ulota wowosi uyeghilwi kwa mapalo gha kimundu, ila wandu walongili habali zya Sapanga handa walongosilwi na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Wavula wa uhwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Pahumilili walota wa uhwangi paghati gha wandu, handa vila wahumilili wavula wa uhwangi paghati mwa mwenga, wandu hagha wateyingisa mavulo gha kubyodosa gha uhwangi hata kuhikila kumlema Bambu yula awakombolili kwaikiva gha nagha wateliyeghela wenibaha mayalamisu kwa bwitu. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Kangi wandu watangala watezikovikela hazi njila zyau zya uhakata, na kwaikiva gha nagha wamonga wateghola njila gha chakaka zipughanyiki. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Kulumatamata lwao watelipatila hindu kuhuma kwa mwenga wakiwalongela milando gha uhwangi. kuhuma dahile ulamula ghao utangasilwi na kuyalamiswa kwa weni kunguwalindila.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Kwaikiva watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba pawagholili sambi, Sapanga kawalekesela ng'ogha, ila awawopili minyololu kumambi kulwisa litopehu wakilindila lichuwa lya ulamulo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Hilahila Sapanga kalekesela ng'ogha mlima wogha haku dahile, ila ayeghili ghalika lya masi kunani gha mlima hula wa wandu walikalili ng'ogha kwa kumtundamila Sapanga, ila Nuhu yula atangasili yala yangupalwa na Sapanga, Sapanga amlokolili mweni pamonga na wandu ghangi isaba. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Hilahila Sapanga anyokolili wandu wa milima gha Sodoma na Gomola kwa kuilungusa lyotu, na kuighola kuwela mlandano wa mighalu hila itewakola wandu wala wamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Sapanga amlokolili Lutu, mundu wa ulungwana, yula avile kang'ung'uliswa nesu na ndyangilu gha wala wandu wakovekela ng'ogha laghililo. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Lutu alikalili paghati gha wandu hagha, na kwa machuwa yatangala moyu ghaki hula ubhaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga uwelili uhomwa nesu pakayughanila na kulola matendu ghao mahakata. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Kwa hayi, hinu, Bambu angumanya njila gha kuwalokola kumayesu wandu wala wangumkwinila mweni, na njila gha kuwawika wahakata ili akawanyokola kulichuwa lila lya ulamulo, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />nesunesu wala wangukovekela lumatamata lwa higha na kupughanya ulongosi wa Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Wavula hagha wa uhwangi ni weni kinyengu na weni kulitutumula hata watila ng'ogha kuwalighu viumbi vyeni ukwilikihi vivile kundumba, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />ila hata watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga weni uweso na makakala nesu, wawasitaki ng'ogha na kuwalighu hagha kuulongolo gha Bambu. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Wandu hagha wangummanya ng'ogha yula wangumlighu. Weni ni handa mikokolo ivile ng'ogha na luhala wala wanguwelekwa na kuulongolo hukolwa na kuhinjwa. Na weni handa mikokolu wateyalamiswa, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />watehipwa mahakilo kwaikiva gha mahakili wayayambusili. Luheku lwau ni kughola chochosi kikwila lumatamata lwa lweni paluagha nesunesu lipindi lya pamuhi. Hinu weni ni handa malembu gha ndaka na walemafu na wanguyegha honi pamlyegha na weni kunu wakiyendelela na njila zyao zya uhwangi. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Mihu gha weni ghamema ngongola na watoka ng'ogha kughola sambi. Wangukwegha wandu wavile na makakala ng'ogha. Mioyu gha weni izyowelela kuwela na lumatamata lwa hindu. Wandu hagha walapilwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Waileka njila gha chakaka na kubyodoka na kuikovekela njila akovekelili Balaamu, mwana wa Beoli, Hayu apalili kupokela vindu kwa njila gha ulungwana ng'ogha, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />ila kwaikiva gha uhakata ghaki akalipililwi na punda, mkokolo kamanya ng'ogha kulongela, akalongela kwa kutumila lilowi lya kimundu na kuukanisa ulukwali wa hayu mlota.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Wala wavula wa uhwangi ni handa uhimbuki uvile ng'ogha na masi, weni handa ukungweta unguyeyeswa na luyegha, mwihu wa wandu hagha ni lwisa ngulu. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Wangulonga milandu gha mikwinakwina na imanyika ng'ogha, na kutumila lumatamata lwau luhakata lya higha kuwakwegha wala wavile havi pabehi waleka njila syao zihakata na wandu wangulikala kuuhwangi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Wakiwalongela wandu waghangi yiwa watewela pekesu, ikiva wenibaha ni wahusutu wa swinda, kwaikiva mundu ni muhusutu wa kindu chochosi kingumlongosa. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Handa watyelembuka kuhuma kuuhakata wa mlima wogha hau kwa kummanya Bambu wa twenga na mlokola Yesu kilisito na pawaghomelwa kangi na sambi na zikawalongosa ngalilu ghao gha mwihu itevile ihakata nesu kupiti hila gha utumbulo. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ingawelili mbaha kwa weni handa waimanyili ng'ogha njila gha chakaka, kupiti badili gha kumanya wangulilema lilaghilo lila lya Sapanga wapeghilwi. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ila kihumila kwa weni hilahila kingulandana na mithali gha chakaka hila ingulonga, “Ghalu anguhuyila kangi kulyegha malukula ghaki mweniba,” na mithali ghangi ilongile, “Lighuluwi yula kaghululwa kala kawuyila kuligalausa kumandakali.” Hagha wangulandana na hagha.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Laghililo lya kuhika kwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Waghanja ghangu, hai ni lihamba gha ivili nivile ninguwayandikila. Kulihamba hasi ivili ninguyesa kuhindula mawachilo maha muluhala gha mwenga kwa kuwakumbwisi muweli na mawachilo ghala yangumuhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ningupala mwenga mkumbwiki milandu ilongilwi dahile na walota wa Sapanga wa dahile na lila lilaghilo lya Bambu na mulokola mpeghilwi na wandumindumi wa mwenga. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Pambila gha hyogha, mmanyi yiwa ku machuwa gha mwihu watehika wandu wavile wangulongoswa na ndyangilo zyao wenibaha na lumatamata na watewapughanya mwenga. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Na kulonga, “Alaghilili yiwa atehika hinaa, kakogha? Mighalu ni yilayila kuhumila mambuyi wa twenga pawahweghili kila kindu kiyendelela handa kiwelili kuhuma mtumbulo wa kulumbwa mlima wogha.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ila weni wangulisiisa kwa lukani uchakaka hau yiwa Sapanga alongili, na kundumba na mlima wogha viwumbilwi. Sapanga alumbili mlima wogha kuhuma mumasi na kwa kutumila masi, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />kupitila kwa masi hagha mlima wogha ukayalamiswa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Kangi kwa lilando halihali kundumba na mlima wogha vivikwa ngoko kwaikiva gha lyoto, kuvikwa maha mbaka lichuwa lila lya ulamulo na gha kuyalamiswa kwa wandu wala wamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ila waghanja ghangu, mkotoho kuisemwa lilando hali, yiwa kwa Bambu, lichuwa limonga lilinganila na machuva ielufu na machuva ielufu yangulinganila na lichuwa limonga. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Bambu angutimila lilaghano lyaki kwa lipindi lya chakaka, ng'ogha handa wandu waghangi wanguliwachila yiwa angukawila. Mweni anguwafumilila mwenga kwaikiva kapala ng'ogha hata mmonga wa mwenga ayalamiki ila angupala kila mmonga wa mwenga aleki sambi.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ila lichuwa lya Bambu litehika handa mwihi. Ndiwa kundumba zyogha zitehuka kwa visindu vikulu na viumbi vyaki vyogha viteyalamiswa kwa lyoto na mlima wogha pamonga na vindu vyaki vyogha viteyalamiswa kwa lyoto. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Hinu kwaikiva vindu vyogha vitekolonganyika handa hagha, ghuli mwenga, mngupalwa kuvile wandu wa ngalilu niki? Mngupalwa kulikala kwaikiva gha Sapanga na kulikala kwa kumtundamila Sapanga, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />mukilindila lichuwa lila lya Sapanga na kupala ihiki kwa kuloposela. Lichuwa hali ndumba zyogha zitelunguswa kwa lyoto na kuyalamiswa, na viumbi vyaki vyogha vya dahile viteyeyuswa kwa lyotu. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Handa alaghilili, tunguilindila ndumba hyonu na mlima wogha hyonu uvile wandu wamhekelesa Sapanga hela wangulikala.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Kwa hagha waghanja ghangu, mkiva mngulilindila lichuwa lila, myangalayi muwesi kuwela pekesu kuulongolo gha Sapanga, na mlikali na mweni kwa kukotoho kutovana kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mngupalwa kulola ufumilifu wa Bambu yiwa ni fwasi ingutughola tulokoki, handa Paulo mlongo wa twenga mpalwa vila kawayandikila kwa kutumila luhala apeghilwi na Sapanga, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />handa ailongile ku lihamba zyaki zyogha. Mighalu mighangi kulihamba hazi ni ikamala kumanya mighalu hai wandyungi na wala wandu wa kuyumbilayumbila wangubyodosa handa vila wangubyodosa mayandiko maghangi makwilikihi. Hinu wanguyambusa mayalamiso ghao wenibaha.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Hinu mwenga wapalwa wa nenga, muimanya kala mighalu hagha, muliloli kwa umaha lukani mkotoho kubyodoswa na mahakata gha wandu wakovekela ng'ogha lilaghililo na kusindwa kugholoka kwa ngangamalu kuukwinila. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ila muyendileli kukula ku ulungwana na kwa kummanya Bambu wa twenga na mlokola Yesu kilisito. Kwa mweni kuvile na ukwilikihi hinaa na hata machuwa yayendelela. Yinaa.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>